    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizruntimedoc-Create Telecom Sim Deactivate-v2-spec",
    "description": "This API allows users to deactivate telecom SIM cards in order to manage service subscriptions effectively. By submitting a request, businesses can streamline the process of terminating active SIM services and ensure compliance with security protocols. The primary resource handled by this API is the telecom SIM, which can be deactivated based on user specifications. This functionality is essential for telecom providers and companies managing large fleets of SIM cards, aiming to minimize unnecessary costs and improve resource allocation.",
